### - Для каждого элемента

for_each_element(matrix_source, operation, value) = new_matrix
    where
        matrix_source: Matrix
        operation: Operation
        value: number
        new_matrix: Matrix

### - Фильтровать по значению

filter_by_value(matrix_source, condition, value) = matrix_target
    where
        matrix_source: Matrix
        condition: Condition
        value: number
        matrix_target: Matrix

### - Фильтровать по матрице

filter_by_matrix(matrix_source, condition, matrix_condition) = matrix_target
    where
        matrix_source: Matrix
        condition: Condition
        matrix_condition: Matrix
        matrix_target: Matrix

### - Для каждой пары

for_each_pair(matrix_source_1, matrix_source_2, operation) = new_matrix
    where
        matrix_source_1: Matrix(...TAxis)
        matrix_source_2: Matrix
        operation: Operation
        new_matrix: Matrix(...TAxis)

## Шаги алгоритма

### 0. Вычисляем суммарные объемы проливов по всем категориям НП в каждом регионе деятельности

volumes_by_district = sum_by_axis(volumes, district)
    where
        volumes_by_district: Matrix(Region, Product_category, Product, Market_participant)
        volumes: Matrix(Region, District, Product_category, Product, Market_participant)
            where
                Region, District, Product_category, Product, Market_participant: Axis
        district: Axis

volumes_by_product_category_region = sum_by_axis(volumes_by_district, product_category)
    where
        volumes_by_product_category_region: Matrix(Region, Product, Market_participant)
        volumes_by_district: Matrix(Region, Product_category, Product, Market_participant)
            where
                Region, Product_category, Product, Market_participant: Axis
        product_category: Axis

### 1. Вычисляем суммарные запрашиваемые объемы по всем НПЗ и регионам поставки

requests_by_market_participant = sum_by_axis(requests, market_participant)
    where
        requests_by_market_participant: Matrix(Product, Refinery, Region)
        requests: Matrix(Product, Refinery, Region, Market_participant)
            where
                Product, Refinery, Region, Market_participant: Axis
        market_participant: Axis

requests_by_market_participant_region = sum_by_axis(requests_by_market_participant, region)
    where
        requests_by_market_participant_region: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
        requests_by_market_participant: Matrix(Product, Refinery, Region)
            where
                Product, Refinery, Region: Axis
        region: Axis

### 2. Умножаем суммарные объемы проливов на переменную «Превышение Доступных объемов по Запросам»

volumes_scaled = for_each_element(requests_by_market_participant_region, multiply, OVERALL_REQUEST_CAPACITY)
    where
        volumes_scaled: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
        requests_by_market_participant_region: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
            where
                Product, Region: Axis
        multiply: Operation
        OVERALL_REQUEST_CAPACITY: number = 120/100
```

### 3. Период дефицита

period_of_deficit = filter_by_matrix(requests_by_market_participant_region, less_than, volumes_scaled)
    where
        period_of_deficit: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
        requests_by_market_participant_region: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
        less_than: Condition
        volumes_scaled: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
            where
                Product, Region: Axis
```

### 3.1. Скользящее среднее

moving_average = for_each_pair(volumes_by_product_category_region, matrix_of_activity, divide)
    where
        moving_average: Matrix(Region, Market_participant)
        volumes_by_product: Matrix(Region, Market_participant)
        divide: Operation
        matrix_of_activity: Matrix(Market_participant)
            where
                Region, Market_participant: Axis

### 4. Период профицита

period_of_surplus = filter_by_matrix(requests_by_market_participant_region, greater_or_equal_to, volumes_scaled)
    where
        period_of_surplus: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
        requests_by_market_participant_region: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
        greater_or_equal_to: Condition
        volumes_scaled: Matrix(Product, Refinery)
            where
                Product, Region: Axis
